class ViewResult(Protocol):
    """A results viewer opens the results page; the estate greets the page, and from then on,
    about once a second, counts the current votes for option a and for option b and sends the
    tally to every open results page, which shows the percentage share of each option, two bars
    sized to the shares and the total number of votes, without a reload."""


